--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data and components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

CC-CEDICT (https://cc-cedict.org/)
    Chinese-English dictionary, licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
    The dictionary itself is NOT distributed with this repository; it is
    downloaded at build time by tools/fetch_cedict.py. Any table produced by
    tools/build_cache.py is a derivative work of CC-CEDICT and must therefore
    be redistributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

Rime dictionaries (rime-wubi, rime-pinyin-simp, https://github.com/rime)
    Used read-only, at runtime, for word frequency ranking.

Argos Translate zh-en model (https://github.com/argosopentech)
    MIT licensed, downloaded optionally by tools/fetch_mt_model.py and not
    distributed with this repository.
